  {
    "slug": "opendoors",
    "title": "#OpenDoors with Home Insurance",
    "subtitle": "",
    "client": "Reliance General Insurance",
    "studio": "OgilvyOne",
    "period": "2013-2017",
    "start": null,
    "categories": [
      "Brand",
      "Digital",
      "Campaign"
    ],
    "featured": false,
    "statement": "",
    "description": "#OpenDoors Film \nfor Reliance general insurance\n\nAs our race progresses, and busy lifestyles engulf our days, we find ourselves confined within the four walls of our homes. The constant fear of theft and crime has made us mistrust the world, and has taken away the beauty of community sharing and human connections. \n\nAmidst all this Shani Shingnapur, a small town in Maharashtra where no home has doors, pops out almost as an anomaly to restore our faith in humanity. \n\n#OpenDoors is a film based on this insight. And it served as the perfect communication approach for Reliance General Insurance to take its Home Insurance product to the masses.",
    "cover": "",
    "story": {},
